          <Components isList="true" count="7">
            <Text81 Ref="101" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,0.6,6.4,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11</Font>
              <Guid>19f56bae6e4e4803a881df7c58918e99</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text81</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
              <Text>Địa điểm giao xe: Tại trụ sở của bên B.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text81>
            <Text82 Ref="102" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,0.6,0.3,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11</Font>
              <Guid>1202cd2b05b34df9b28af6fb7adc2867</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text82</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
              <Text>2.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text82>
            <Text83 Ref="103" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <ClientRectangle>0,0,6.9,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11,Bold</Font>
              <Guid>730d71253c804317b2bba0d246958cc2</Guid>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text83</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
              <Text>ĐIỀU 4: THỜI GIAN KÝ ĐƠN ĐẶT HÀNG VÀ GIAO HÀNG DỰ KIẾN</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
              <VertAlignment>Center</VertAlignment>
            </Text83>
            <Text84 Ref="104" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanBreak>True</CanBreak>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,0.2,6.4,0.4</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11</Font>
              <Guid>64ec92af746a4978970bd8a4fe12ba41</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text84</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
              <Text>Việc giao hàng cho bên A dự kiến sẽ được thực hiện trong , tùy theo lịch giao hàng của TMV và sau khi bên B nhận đủ 100% giá trị Hợp đồng.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text84>
            <Text85 Ref="105" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,0.2,0.3,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11</Font>
              <Guid>ced63bce1c3548f3acf4df21456086ec</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text85</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
              <Text>1.</Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text85>
            <Text86 Ref="106" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <AllowHtmlTags>True</AllowHtmlTags>
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.5,0.8,6.4,0.7</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11</Font>
              <Guid>10ea99c7de2943a8b2a52d752a743800</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text86</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
              <Text>Trong vòng &lt;u&gt;&lt;i&gt;15 ngày làm việc&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/u&gt; trước ngày giao hàng thực tế, Bên B sẽ thông báo bằng văn bản, điện thoại, fax hoặc e-mail cho Bên A. Trừ trường hợp bất khả kháng, nếu Bên B không thực hiện hai nghĩa vụ nêu trên, Bên A có quyền đơn phương chấm dứt hợp đồng và nhận lại khoản tiền đặt cọc đã nộp cho Bên B. </Text>
              <TextBrush>Black</TextBrush>
              <TextOptions>HotkeyPrefix=None, LineLimit=False, RightToLeft=False, Trimming=None, WordWrap=True, Angle=0, FirstTabOffset=40, DistanceBetweenTabs=20,</TextOptions>
              <TextQuality>Wysiwyg</TextQuality>
              <Type>Expression</Type>
            </Text86>
            <Text87 Ref="107" type="Text" isKey="true">
              <Brush>Transparent</Brush>
              <CanGrow>True</CanGrow>
              <ClientRectangle>0.2,0.8,0.3,0.2</ClientRectangle>
              <Conditions isList="true" count="0" />
              <Font>Arial,11</Font>
              <Guid>b79afeaa28c44771a48238d65944c214</Guid>
              <HorAlignment>Width</HorAlignment>
              <Margins>0,0,0,0</Margins>
              <Name>Text87</Name>
              <Page isRef="72" />
              <Parent isRef="100" />
